Surround yourself with a defensive aura, increasing armor by [3, 6, 9, 12, 15 (TL1-5)], and inflicting [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire and [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage to all attacking foes.

Additionally, your vim will enhance your defences, reducing all damage by [4%, 9%, 15%, 20%, 25% (TL1-5)] of your current vim (currently 0), but never reducing by more than half of the original damage. This will cost vim equal to 5% of the damage blocked.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
